; keytrap.example.test: the KeyTrap-style zone of M38 (WP10.2). validation.sh appends many
; DNSKEY records whose key tag collides with the zone-signing key's before BIND signs it,
; so that a validator without caps would try every one; Tenko answers within its caps.
$ORIGIN keytrap.example.test.
$TTL 300
@       IN SOA  bind.example.test. hostmaster.example.test. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@       IN NS   bind.example.test.
www     IN A    192.0.2.90
